# Temple of the Dead: "{2}{B}, {T}: Transform this land. Activate only if a player has one or fewer cards in hand and
# only as a sorcery." Bot1 has an empty hand until its turn-3 draw (one card, Swamp, which it keeps), so the condition
# holds; Bot2's hand is large. Aclazotz died on Bot2's turn 2 (two Lightning Bolts) and came back tapped as the Temple.
# Sorcery timing: in Bot1's upkeep the condition already holds (empty hand) but the ability is not offered; in its main
# phase with an empty stack, it is. The Temple taps as a cost (CR 602.2) and the Swamp, Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl pay {2}{B};
# the land turns over into Aclazotz, a 4/4 flying lifelink creature, tapped. It has been under Bot1's control since before the
# turn began (it re-entered on turn 2), so it is not summoning sick.

